  "contract": "One exact UPSERT with supplied time; void result, insert enabled1/polling0 defaults, conflict changes only filter and update time. No helper clock/transaction/constructor/backfill/callback/retry; caller transaction and statement failure retain legacy rollback.",
  "auditLimit": "Conservative helper/wrapper/constructor/read units and complete read modules counted. Actual filter RPC with existing and empty synthetic Spaces is characterized. Unchanged public handler/config-store/app files pinned; their full transitive GitHub/plugin/startup/Space closure is not audited. Public filter and saved snapshot writes remain on main; atomic command and public wiring are separate rungs."
